    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "<a href=\"https://suncraftedma.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Suncrafted’s</a> products have been harvested from plants that thrived under direct sunlight. Their live rosin, derived from an ice water bath of its plants, forms the sustainable base ingredient for many of its products which include rosin cartridges, tinctures and gummies. With Suncrafted, you’ll be choosing some of the cleanest and finest cannabis products available in adult use market!"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "Interested in learning more? Join our pop up with Suncrafted February 2 from 5:00-7:00pm @ CastleLeaf!"
    },
